    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d133">

                <pb facs="0165" n="131" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg131"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Porter to Mr. Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>. [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1897-07-05T09:00:00-05:00"
                            notBefore="1897-07-03T00:00:00-05:00">undated</date>.] (Received July
                        5—9 a.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegram received. Wrote full particulars in dispatch of 28th. Have talked
                    further with most influential members of Government, and all <pb facs="0166"
                        n="132" xml:id="pg132"/> feel that Government will not support the bills and
                    they are not likely to pass. Am watching them carefully.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Porter.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
